      *################################################################*00010000
      *                                                                 00020000
      * FD International Services                                       00030000
      *                                                                 00040000
      * Copy-area R115ICU0.                                             00050001
      *                                                                 00060000
      * Interface for all database access on table TF_Customer.         00070001
      *                                                                 00080000
      * The interface kan read one spesific occurence,                  00090000
      * or several occurences, fully or partly qualified.               00100004
      *                                                                 00120000
      * When reading several occurences, one must always start with     00130000
      * -In-Get-1st, and continue with -In-Get-Next.                    00140000
      *                                                                 00150000
      * NB!  There are several key-fields, which may be used            00160000
      *      differently depending on the need.                         00170000
      *      See seperate description below.                            00180000
      *                                                                 00190000
      *                                                                 00200000
      * An ordinary call may look like this:                            00210000
      *                                                                 00220000
      *    Initialize                          R115ICU0-Customer        00230001
      *    Set   R115ICU0-Version        To    True                     00240001
      *    Set   R115ICU0-In-Select      To    True                     00250001
      *                                                                 00251002
      *    Move  &fin-inst-id            To    R115iCU0-In-Fin-Inst-ID  00251003
      *    Move  &customer-id            To    R115iCU0-In-Customer-ID  00251004
      *                                                                 00254213
      *    Call  'F115ICU0'              Using R115ICU0-Customer        00330001
      *                                        R7919999-Error           00340000
      *    End-Call                                                     00350000
      *                                                                 00360000
      *    Evaluate True                                                00370000
      *      When R7919999-Retur-Abend                                  00380000
      *        Move  '&&&&'              To    R7919999-Paragraf        00390000
      *        Perform Z900-Abend                                       00400000
      *                                                                 00410000
      *      When R7919999-Retur-Feil                                   00420000
      *        ...not found...                                          00430000
      *                                                                 00440000
      *      When R7919999-Retur-OK                                     00450000
      *        ...found...                                              00460000
      *                                                                 00470000
      *    End-Evaluate                                                 00480000
      *                                                                 00490000
      *################################################################*00500000
      * Date ! Si! Change description                            ! 3A ! 00510000
      *------+---+-----------------------------------------------+----+ 00520000
      *160101!NDL! New copy area                                 !LT12! 00530000
      *################################################################*00540000
      *                                                                 00550000
         03  R115ICU0-Customer.                                         00560001
      *                                                                 00570000
           05  R115ICU0-Version-No              Pic  X(08).             00580001
             88  R115ICU0-Version                    Value '20010115'.  00590001
      *                                                                 00600000
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*00610000
      *                                                                 00620000
           05  R115ICU0-Qualification.                                  00630001
      *                                                                 00640000
             10  R115ICU0-In-Action             Pic  X(16).             00650001
               88  R115ICU0-In-Get-1st               Value 'GET-1ST'.   00660001
               88  R115ICU0-In-Get-Next              Value 'GET-NEXT'.  00670001
               88  R115ICU0-In-Insert                Value 'INSERT'.    00680001
               88  R115ICU0-In-Update                Value 'UPDATE'.    00690001
               88  R115ICU0-In-Delete                Value 'DELETE'.    00700001
               88  R115ICU0-In-Select                Value 'SELECT'.    00830001
      *                                                                 00850000
      * There are several key-fields, which may be used differently     00860000
      * depending on the need.                                          00870000
      *                                                                 00880000
      * For Insert, use the Data area for all fields.                   00891002
      *                                                                 00892002
      * For Select, Update and Delete, use:                             00892003
      *     - Fin-Inst-No or Fin-Inst-ID                                00892006
      *     - Customer-No or Customer-ID                                00892007
      *                                                                 00892009
      * For cursor (Get-1st / Get-Next), use:                           00980000
      *     - Optional: Fin-Inst-No or Fin-Inst-ID                      00980100
      *     - Optional: Bic-Code  (e.g. 'HANDNON') with mask            00990009
      *       buth minimun 4, 6 or more characters                      00990010
      *                 (If used, Fin-Inst is mandatory)                00990020
      * OR                                                              01030000
      * For cursor (Get-1st / Get-Next), use:                           01030100
      *     - Optional: Fin-Inst-No or Fin-Inst-ID                      01030200
      *     - Optional: ID-Surname  with mask                           01030210
      *     - Optional: Country-Code                                    01030211
      *                 (If used, Fin-Inst is mandatory)                01030230
      *                                                                 01030240
      *                                                                 01030300
             10  R115ICU0-In-Key.                                       01040001
      *                                                                 01040003
      *        Fin-Inst is mandatory.                                   01040004
      *        It is optional wether you use Fin-Inst-No or Fin-Inst-ID.01040005
               15  R115iCU0-In-Fin-Inst.                                01040006
                 20  R115iCU0-In-Fin-Inst-No    Pic  X(18).             01040007
                 20  R115iCU0-In-Fin-Inst-ID    Pic S9(18)       Comp-3.01040008
      *                                                                 01040009
      *        Customer-ID or Customer-No is mandatory for              01040010
      *        Select/Update/Delete.                                    01040011
      *        It is optional wether you use Customer-No or Customer-ID.01040012
               15  R115iCU0-In-Customer.                                01040030
                 20  R115iCU0-In-Customer-No    Pic S9(11)       Comp-3.01040040
                 20  R115iCU0-In-Customer-ID    Pic S9(11)       Comp-3.01040050
      *                                                                 01040060
      *        Bic-Code is only relevant for cursor (Get-1st/Get-Next)  01040090
               15  R115ICU0-In-Bic-Code.                                01041012
                 20  R115ICU0-In-Bank           pic X(4).               01050002
                 20  R115ICU0-In-Country        pic X(2).               01060002
                 20  R115ICU0-In-Location       pic X(2).               01061002
                 20  R115ICU0-In-Branch         pic X(3).               01062002
      *                                                                 01062003
      *        Surname and Country-Code is only relevant for cursor     01062004
      *        (Get-1st/Get-Next)                                       01062005
               15  R115ICU0-In-ID-Surname       Pic X(15).              01062006
               15  R115ICU0-In-Country-Code     Pic X(02).              01062007
      *                                                                 01070000
      * When performing a Get-1st-call one may ask for the total        01140000
      * number of rows complying with the qualification.                01150000
      *                                                                 01160000
             10  R115ICU0-In-Code-Count         Pic  X(10).             01170001
               88  R115ICU0-In-CC-Count              Value 'COUNT'.     01180001
      *                                                                 01190000
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*01200000
      *                                                                 01210000
           05  R115ICU0-Data.                                           01220001
      *                                                                 01230000
             10  R115ICU0-Key.                                          01254005
               15  R115ICU0-Fin-Inst-ID         Pic S9(18)       Comp-3.01254006
               15  R115ICU0-Customer-ID         Pic S9(11)       Comp-3.01254007
               15  R115ICU0-Customer-No         Pic S9(11)       Comp-3.01254008
               15  R115ICU0-Bic-Code.                                   01254009
                 20  R115ICU0-Bic-Bank          pic X(4).               01254010
                 20  R115ICU0-Bic-Country       pic X(2).               01254011
                 20  R115ICU0-Bic-Location      pic X(2).               01254012
                 20  R115ICU0-Bic-Branch        pic X(3).               01254013
               15  R115iCU0-Surname             Pic X(35).              01254014
               15  R115iCU0-ID-Surname          Pic X(15).              01254014
               15  R115iCU0-Country-Code        Pic X(02).              01254015
                                                                        01254016
             10  Filler.                                                01254020
               15  R115iCU0-Fin-Inst-No         Pic  X(18).             01254030
