             10  R115ICU0-Firstname             Pic  X(35).             01360003
             10  R115ICU0-Address-1             Pic  X(35).             01370003
             10  R115ICU0-Address-2             Pic  X(35).             01370004
             10  R115ICU0-Address-3             Pic  X(35).             01370005
             10  R115ICU0-Address-4             Pic  X(35).             01370006
             10  R115ICU0-Sector-Code           Pic S9(04)       Comp.  01370008
             10  R115ICU0-Postal-Code           Pic S9(04)       Comp.  01370009
             10  R115ICU0-Destination           Pic  X(32).             01370010
